WEBVTT
Kind: captions
Language: en

00:00:00.399 --> 00:00:04.650
Speaker 1: Hey, this you have to see a Republican
official who represents Orange County, California,

00:00:04.650 --> 00:00:11.519
named Don Wagner seriously asked during a
hearing whether covid-19 vaccines have a tracking

00:00:11.519 --> 00:00:12.519
device in them.

00:00:12.519 --> 00:00:13.679
Now, I know we see this on Facebook.

00:00:13.679 --> 00:00:15.070
OK, you're wacky.

00:00:15.070 --> 00:00:18.039
Uncle might be sharing it, but this is not
your wacky uncle.

00:00:18.039 --> 00:00:19.039
This is it.

00:00:19.039 --> 00:00:20.170
Well, maybe it's someone's wacky uncle.

00:00:20.170 --> 00:00:22.130
This is an actual elected official.

00:00:22.130 --> 00:00:26.929
It is Supervisor Don Wagner from Orange County
representing many, many people.

00:00:26.929 --> 00:00:31.160
The question came at an Orange County Board
of Supervisors meeting where the prospect

00:00:31.160 --> 00:00:33.980
of so-called vaccine passports was being discussed.

00:00:33.980 --> 00:00:37.950
Now, we know that Don Wagner himself has been
vaccinated.

00:00:37.950 --> 00:00:42.360
He tweeted back on April 3rd with a picture
of himself, one and done with the Johnson

00:00:42.360 --> 00:00:44.070
and Johnson vaccine.

00:00:44.070 --> 00:00:45.730
Start to finish was forty five minutes.

00:00:45.730 --> 00:00:47.600
Great job to everybody.

00:00:47.600 --> 00:00:51.400
And thank you to Dr. Chao for administering
my shot, quick and painless.

00:00:51.400 --> 00:00:57.940
But here is the same Don Wagner apparently
asking the same Dr. Chao, it seems, who administered

00:00:57.940 --> 00:01:01.900
his vaccine about tracking devices.

00:01:01.900 --> 00:01:03.330
You have to see it to believe it.

00:01:03.330 --> 00:01:04.330
Take a look.

00:01:04.330 --> 00:01:07.240
Speaker 3: It's only at the patient's request.

00:01:07.240 --> 00:01:08.240
That's correct.

00:01:08.240 --> 00:01:13.930
Speaker 2: Does it is there any intention
of tracking folks?

00:01:13.930 --> 00:01:15.970
No.

00:01:15.970 --> 00:01:22.290
Is there any in the vaccine we heard about
an injection of a tracking device, is is that

00:01:22.290 --> 00:01:24.170
being done anywhere?

00:01:24.170 --> 00:01:30.890
Speaker 3: In Orange County, I'm sorry,
Speaker 5: I just have to compose myself.

00:01:30.890 --> 00:01:37.650
There is not a vaccine with a tracking device
embedded in it that I know of exists in the

00:01:37.650 --> 00:01:38.650
world.

00:01:38.650 --> 00:01:39.650
Period.

00:01:39.650 --> 00:01:46.299
Speaker 1: OK, now I have some news for Don
Wagner that might be shocking to him if he's

00:01:46.299 --> 00:01:48.410
worried about being tracked.

00:01:48.410 --> 00:01:52.250
He is carrying around a tracking device all
day, every day.

00:01:52.250 --> 00:01:57.600
It is his mobile phone, the mobile phone he
carries around in his pocket, probably without

00:01:57.600 --> 00:01:58.600
a second thought.

00:01:58.600 --> 00:02:00.660
He has a GPS tracker.

00:02:00.660 --> 00:02:06.720
Law enforcement, if he were accused of a crime,
could subpoena access to his location depending

00:02:06.720 --> 00:02:08.270
on his app permissions.

00:02:08.270 --> 00:02:10.689
Apps can get access to his location.

00:02:10.689 --> 00:02:15.269
It's in his pocket or sitting on his desk
in front of him as he asks whether the covid

00:02:15.269 --> 00:02:17.959
vaccine has a tracking device in it.

00:02:17.959 --> 00:02:20.879
This is something I think about every time
these guys bring this up.

00:02:20.879 --> 00:02:24.739
The technology piece doesn't exist to do this.

00:02:24.739 --> 00:02:29.239
If you look at that syringe, it just doesn't
exist.

00:02:29.239 --> 00:02:31.280
But why would you need to do it?

00:02:31.280 --> 00:02:37.549
And I know people will say, oh, but what about
the injected microchips into dogs or dogs?

00:02:37.549 --> 00:02:40.829
That's a dramatically different size.

00:02:40.829 --> 00:02:42.709
And that is not a real time tracker.

00:02:42.709 --> 00:02:44.959
That is something you can scan.

00:02:44.959 --> 00:02:47.280
If a dog shows up, you can scan it for a microchip.

00:02:47.280 --> 00:02:48.650
It will tell you the owner's name.

00:02:48.650 --> 00:02:51.159
Completely different thing, not equivalent.

00:02:51.159 --> 00:02:53.439
Why go through the trouble?

00:02:53.439 --> 00:02:58.109
Of injecting billions of people globally with
a vaccine in order to track them when they

00:02:58.109 --> 00:03:01.150
are already carrying around GPS and mobile
phones.

00:03:01.150 --> 00:03:04.629
Does he use a debit card or a credit card,
which leaves a breadcrumb trail of where he

00:03:04.629 --> 00:03:09.810
has been, an ATM card, which says, where were
you physically withdrawing cash?

00:03:09.810 --> 00:03:14.730
Does he wear a mask all day as he walks around
in front of hundreds of CCTV cameras and security

00:03:14.730 --> 00:03:16.790
cameras of various kinds?

00:03:16.790 --> 00:03:20.769
My instinct is also that there's kind of a
moral hazard at play, which is a funny one

00:03:20.769 --> 00:03:21.769
in insurance.

00:03:21.769 --> 00:03:27.040
There is this idea that the people insurance
companies most want to insure are the people

00:03:27.040 --> 00:03:29.129
who don't really need insurance.

00:03:29.129 --> 00:03:34.189
The people that really want insurance and
can't afford not to have it are the risks

00:03:34.189 --> 00:03:36.659
that many insurance companies would prefer
not to take on.

00:03:36.659 --> 00:03:42.579
My instinct here is that the very people who
believe there is a microchip in the vaccine

00:03:42.579 --> 00:03:46.739
are the people doing nothing that would even
be remotely interesting or worthy of being

00:03:46.739 --> 00:03:48.159
tracked to begin with.

00:03:48.159 --> 00:03:50.950
Why on earth does government want to track?

00:03:50.950 --> 00:03:57.400
Like my weird classmate from high school who
posts vaccine tracking Conspiracy's to Facebook,

00:03:57.400 --> 00:04:01.560
who works part time at a garden supply store
and never otherwise goes anywhere?

00:04:01.560 --> 00:04:03.170
Like who cares where she's going?

00:04:03.170 --> 00:04:08.540
Does she thinks she's so important that the
government even cares to know where she is?

00:04:08.540 --> 00:04:12.589
Advertisers want to know in order to sell
her stuff, but she's already giving them that

00:04:12.589 --> 00:04:17.019
information by using a smartphone posting
about her likes and dislikes on Facebook and

00:04:17.019 --> 00:04:18.019
the like.

00:04:18.019 --> 00:04:19.799
I by the way, I followed her on Facebook.

00:04:19.799 --> 00:04:21.820
It became completely unbearable.

00:04:21.820 --> 00:04:27.550
But the point here is, why would the government
even want to track ninety nine point ninety

00:04:27.550 --> 00:04:29.419
nine percent of these people to begin with?

00:04:29.419 --> 00:04:32.060
It is a sad state of affairs out there.

00:04:32.060 --> 00:04:34.200
And this guy represents people.

00:04:34.200 --> 00:04:35.770
If you can imagine that.

00:04:35.770 --> 00:04:41.970
Let me know if you've had encounters with
these types of find me on Twitter at David

00:04:41.970 --> 00:04:44.740
Pakman and tell me tell me how you dealt with
it.

00:04:44.740 --> 00:04:49.180
I'm curious to hear we have a great program
for you today.

00:04:49.180 --> 00:06:24.130
Glad you're with us.

